<title>UK: Ladbroke to buy Colorado Gaming.</title>
<headline>Ladbroke to buy Colorado Gaming.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>British hotels and leisure firm Ladbroke Group Plc said on Monday it had agreed to buy Colorado Gaming &amp; Entertainment Co for $6.25 per share, or about $35 million.</p>
<p>Ladbroke said it would also assume about $50 million of the company's debt. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
